cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LocaNoto, please cite it as below."
title: "LocaNoto: local AI knowledge base for companies"
type: software
abstract: >-
  LocaNoto answers questions about a company's own documents, mailboxes,
  calendars, databases and Excel lists with sources (retrieval-augmented
  generation). It runs on the company's own premises with local language
  models, on Docker or Kubernetes.
authors:
  - family-names: Wilhelm
    given-names: Markus
    affiliation: >-
      Technical University of Applied Sciences Würzburg-Schweinfurt (THWS),
      Institute for Digital Engineering (IDEE)
repository-code: "https://github.com/mw-research/LocaNoto"
url: "https://mw-research.github.io/LocaNoto/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - RAG
  - local LLM
  - knowledge base
  - document search
  - self-hosted
  - SME
